<title>USA: Seagoville, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Seagoville, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $1.400 million of Seagoville, Texas, tax, water and sewer system surplus revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2426 percent.</p>
</text>
